// A scenario whose Given contradicts a specification.
// Expected: the Given of 'Idle printer' contradicts 'Printer is idle' (an idle printer's jobs is empty).

Entity Printer {
    Actions: start, print
    Data properties: jobs: a list
    States: online, idle
}

Role Operator.

Action start { Initiators: Operator }
Action print { Initiators: Operator }

Declarative specification Printer is idle means {
    it is online
    AND the jobs is empty
}

Declarative specification Printer is online means {
    the jobs is not full
}

Scenario: Idle printer
Given the Printer is idle AND "report.pdf" is included in the Printer's jobs
When start is executed
Then print is pending.
